# Working notes for continuing `zed-raku`

Context/handoff doc so a future session (human or model) can pick this up
without re-discovering everything. Read this first, then
`grammar-status.plan` (fixes + gaps) and `zed-raku-extension.plan` (milestones).

Last updated: 2026-09-20

---

