## 8. Remaining work (see `grammar-status.plan` §3)

- `q:to/END/` heredocs (hard; low priority).
- Quote adverbs / unicode quotelike delimiters (`q:!c{...}`, `q«...»`).
- Junction-specific highlighting (cosmetic).
- `token`/`rule`/`regex` bodies parsed opaquely (not highlighted as regexes).
- Misc unprobed: word metaoperators (`Zmax`), `o=`, `.()` invoke, etc.

## 9. Key extension files

- `extension.toml` — id `raku`, languages raku+pod, grammar revs, LSP entry.
- `languages/raku/{config,highlights,brackets,indents,outline,textobjects,injections,overrides}`.
- `languages/pod/*` — POD language (grammar `tree-sitter-pod`, Artistic 2.0).
- `src/raku.rs` — minimal extension impl + RakuNavigator command resolution.
- `test/highlight.raku` — the smoke test.
- `.plans/` — this file, `grammar-status.plan`, `zed-raku-extension.plan`.
